0..55 Comment "// The site that hosts the migration model\'s far world."
56..58 Comment "//"
59..135 Comment "// A site is one place a world runs at, the key it proves and the sockets it"
136..211 Comment "// is reached at. Written as a file, the place stays out of the program and"
212..232 Comment "// out of the flags."
233..235 Comment "//"
236..315 Comment "// `gandr host --site` binds these sockets in place of `--net-bind`, and proves"
316..395 Comment "// the key with the secret `GANDR_NET_SECRET` holds. The secret never stands in"
396..471 Comment "// the file. This key is the one the two-process test\'s host secret proves."
472..474 Comment "//"
